    "title": "Score of Parentheses",
    "category": "Stack",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "The score of a balanced parentheses string is defined as follows: \"()\" has score 1. \"AB\" has score A + B, where A and B are balanced parentheses strings. \"(A)\" has score 2 \u00d7 A. Given a balanced parentheses string, compute its score.",
    "input": "A balanced parentheses string.",
    "output": "A single integer representing its score.",
    "constraints": "2 <= s.length <= 50 s is balanced."
